      "pp.extra1.title": "Data Source Statement*",
      "pp.extra1.text": "The Stargazer Tower is a non-profit organization established on Earth by the Shattered Pioneer Empire of The Grove Between Stars, charged with the limited disclosure of information regarding Kepler-452b. Headquartered in Rome, it is jointly operated by the Knights Hospitaller and the National Democratic Institute. The Kepler-452b data submitted by the Stargazer Tower is at variance with NASA's data. All languages use literal translation (e.g., the aquatic monster is rendered as \"Kappa\"; the large, white, horned and docile herbivore as \"White Deer\").",
      "pp.extra2.title": "The Ecstatic Mendeleev*",
      "pp.extra2.text": "Just as humanity's great pioneers had surmised, the physical parameters of the stellar region surrounding Kepler-452b do not perfectly match those of the Sun. Within its atmosphere there even exist several as-yet unidentified elements.",
