      "cur.overview.body": "The system operates on three tiers: sovereign currencies, regional settlement blocs, and a planet-wide clearing mechanism established by the Planetary Safeguard Program. The latter uses a resource-equivalent unit and remains the only settlement framework spanning all major civilizations, though its legal ownership is still disputed..",
